==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description          ^ Default configuration   ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi           | 192.168.1.1/24          |
| vlan1 (eth0.1)   | LAN ports (1 to 4)   | None                    |
| vlan2 (eth0.2)   | WAN port             | DHCP                    |
| wlan0            | WiFi                 | Disabled                |


==== Buttons ====
-> [[docs:guide-user:hardware:hardware.button]] on howto use and configure the hardware button(s).
Here, we merely name the buttons, so we can use them in the above Howto.

The D-Link DWR-116 has the following buttons:

^ BUTTON   ^ Event   ^ GPIO   ^
^ Reset    |  reset  | 1      |
^ WPS      |   wps   | 2      |

==== LEDs ====

The D-Link DWR-116 has the following LEDs:

^ LED      ^            GPIO            ^
^ Status   |             0              |
^ WAN      |  14 (The same as UART TX)  |
^ WiFi     |             72             |
^ LAN1     |             43             |
^ LAN2     |             42             |
^ LAN3     |             41             |
^ LAN4     |             40             |


